This is complete verification, not evidence of it. Since [38;5;10mj = (n >> 23) & 0x1ff[0m sweeps all 512 values and the mantissa sweeps all 2²³, every single entry of both tables is exercised — so the exhaustive pass also proves the tables are transcribed correctly.[0m[0m
