On that transcription: I parsed the 1,024 hex constants out of [38;5;10mc_src/src/lib.c[0m with a script and emitted the Rust literals from that data, rather than copying 110 lines of hex by hand. Hand-transcription is exactly where a silent single-digit error would hide, and it would be invisible in a spot-check.[0m[0m
